# Definitions, aliases ("call it"), and redefinition across one session
let f of x be x squared plus 1
call it g
what is f of 3?
what is g of 3?
what is its range?
let f of x be x cubed plus 2
what is f of 3?
what is g of 3?
call it h
what is h of 2?
define k of x as x squared minus 4
what are the roots of k?
what is k of 5?
what is its derivative?
f of 5
what is f of g of 2?
